; Send each member its own bundle over the air.
FORM BUNDLE_SEND
TITLE Send startup bundles
SUMMARY Sends each station its own signed bundle over the air, frequencies sealed to its card when you have checked it.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 61
ACTION bundle_send
FIELD to Send to(@stations+) required
FIELD label Label(X) upper max=40
BEGIN_HELP
Send to:
One or more stations. A station whose card you haven't checked gets a bundle without frequencies and a step to send you its card.
END
